OL,3,GNEWSABlackpool 'chuffed' to make City
OL,4,Aof Culture shortlist
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Blackpool Council has
OL,7,Fsaid she is "just so chuffed for
OL,8,Feveryone" after the resort was
OL,9,Fshortlisted in the competition to
OL,10,Fbecome the UK's City of Culture in
OL,11,F2029.
OL,13,FBlackpool, Milton Keynes, Sheffield and
OL,14,FWrexham are in the running to become
OL,15,Fthe fifth holder of the title, with the
OL,16,Feventual winner set to receive #10m to
OL,17,Fdeliver a year of cultural events and
OL,18,Factivities.
OL,20,FLynn Williams said she was "thrilled,
OL,21,Fdelighted" and "very proud" of the
OL,22,F"team effort" to get this far.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
