OL,3,GNEWSABlackpool 'chuffed' to make City
OL,4,Aof Culture shortlist
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm really super-excited about what we
OL,7,Fdo, how we build on this, [and how] we
OL,8,Fcarry forward this momentum," she told
OL,9,FBBC Radio Lancashire.
